@startuml
title 数学建模比赛管理系统——用例图
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor 用户 as User
actor 赛事管理员 as Admin
actor 评审专家 as Expert
actor 指导教师 as Advisor
actor 队长 as Leader
actor 队员 as Member

User <|-- Admin
User <|-- Expert
User <|-- Advisor
User <|-- Leader
User <|-- Member

rectangle "数学建模比赛管理系统" {
  usecase "创建与发布赛事" as UC1
  usecase "配置规则与时间节点" as UC1a
  usecase "发布题目与公告" as UC1b
  usecase "注册队伍与维护成员" as UC2
  usecase "审核报名资格" as UC3
  usecase "上传与管理论文版本" as UC4
  usecase "提交/撤回/重新提交" as UC4a
  usecase "截止锁定" as UC4b
  usecase "分配评审任务与回避" as UC5
  usecase "查看回避关系" as UC5a
  usecase "匿名评审与评分提交" as UC6
  usecase "校验评分与必填项" as UC6a
  usecase "监控评审进度与异常处理" as UC7
  usecase "成绩汇总与结果发布" as UC8
  usecase "提交申诉" as UC9
  usecase "处理申诉与复核" as UC9a
  usecase "查询审计日志" as UC10
  usecase "导出与赛事归档" as UC11
  usecase "团队协作记录" as UC12
  usecase "报名截止处理" as EX1
  usecase "文件校验失败提示" as EX2
  usecase "专家拒评/逾期处理" as EX3
  usecase "成绩计算错误暂停发布" as EX4
}

Admin --> UC1
Admin --> UC3
Admin --> UC5
Admin --> UC7
Admin --> UC8
Admin --> UC9a
Admin --> UC10
Admin --> UC11
Expert --> UC6
Expert --> UC7
Advisor --> UC2
Advisor --> UC12
Leader --> UC2
Leader --> UC4
Leader --> UC9
Leader --> UC12
Member --> UC2
Member --> UC4
Member --> UC12

UC1 .> UC1a : <<include>>
UC1 .> UC1b : <<include>>
UC4 .> UC4a : <<include>>
UC4 .> UC4b : <<include>>
UC5 .> UC5a : <<include>>
UC6 .> UC6a : <<include>>
UC9 .> UC9a : <<extend>>
EX1 .> UC2 : <<extend>>
EX1 .> UC4 : <<extend>>
EX2 .> UC4 : <<extend>>
EX3 .> UC5 : <<extend>>
EX3 .> UC7 : <<extend>>
EX4 .> UC8 : <<extend>>

note right of UC8
赛事生命周期：草稿→报名开放→资格审核→
材料提交→评审中→结果发布→已归档
end note
@enduml
